.forge/

# Generated per distribution by scripts/use-manifest.mjs.
# The committed source of truth is manifests/manifest.template.yml plus
# manifests/variants.json. A checkout has no manifest.yml until you run
#   npm run manifest:marketplace   (or manifest:internal)
# which is deliberate: there is no default app, so nobody can deploy to the
# wrong one by accident.
manifest.yml

# Internal-only — deliberately NOT in this public repository.
#
# docs/ carries the Jira site name, a work email, named colleagues and the
# full August 2026 mass-deletion narrative. recovery/ is hard-coded with the
# issue keys that incident touched. Publishing that would tie real people to
# a timesheet-deletion incident on the open internet, and GitHub caches and
# indexes what it receives — deleting later does not undo it.
#
# These live in Confluence, which is where they were written for. If they
# ever should live alongside the code, make the repository private first.
docs/
recovery/
